Description: A 'DBI' driver for 'SlothDB' (<https://github.com/SouravRoy-ETL/slothdb>),
    an analytical SQL engine whose C++ source is bundled and compiled when
    the package is installed. SQL queries over local 'CSV', 'Parquet',
    'JSON' and 'Arrow' IPC files, and over in-memory or file-backed
    databases, then need no system library, no server and no download.
    The engine is experimental, and this package is not a replacement for
    'duckdb': it is offline only, and a database file is tied to the
    engine commit the package bundles.
